Error [jet.UnknownMethod]: `double` is a function, not a method
  --> tests/ui/call_spelling_function_dot.jet:7:13
    |
  7 |     print(n.double())
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: A free function is called as `double(value, …)`; only a method, or a free function whose first parameter is `#Root`, is called after a value and a dot
 Fix: Write `double(value, …)`, or mark the first parameter of `double` `#Root` so it takes both spellings
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0311
